open a file for reading called 'the envelope' at 2147483647.
If 'the envelope's descriptor is not 2147483647 then, Print "ASSERT FIL-43: expected 2147483647 got {'the envelope's descriptor}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope's descriptor.
a boolean called 'the envelope found an error already pending' is false.
